# Thunder on the Plains: a golden afternoon on the savanna turns to storm - eagles wheel, the clouds close in, lightning strikes and the wild horses bolt.
film    thunder-plains
name    Thunder on the Plains
about   A golden afternoon on the savanna: eagles wheel over the acacias and wild horses graze until a storm rolls in, lightning strikes and the herd bolts across the plain.
scene   film_assets/wild/set.pbrt
length  60
still   38
tags    nature, savanna, storm, horses, showcase

terrain  hills  size 2500  height 40  seed 7
biome    savanna
mute     birds        # the music carries it: no birdsong, no cries
sky      15:30 16:30  south 0  haze 4
herd     horses 26  from -120 0  to 900 -60  speed 1.2  flee 33
flock    eagles 3  at 40 45 -60  radius 40
storm    rain  strength 0.9  from 16 to 60  wind 120  speed 16
slowmo   41 47 0.3

shot 0 The plain
  key   0 6 60   0 10 -500   48
  key   20 6 60   -20 10 -500   48
shot 9 Wheeling
  follow flock1  behind 35  up 6  fov 40
shot 17 The storm comes
  key   -60 12 120   100 60 -1200   52
  key   -60 12 110   140 60 -1200   52
shot 27 The herd
  key   -60 2.5 30   -100 1.5 0   40
  focus herd1
  aperture 0.03
shot 33 They bolt
  track herd1  side 16  height 1.8  fov 40
  focus herd1
  aperture 0.04
shot 50 The rain
  key   60 3 30   200 2 -200   50
  key   65 3 26   205 2 -205   50
